    "introduction": "Once and Again focuses on the relationship between a divorced man and a soon to be divorced woman. Both have kids and between the struggles of being a single parent and careers they often find it difficult to spend time together. The show is unique in letting the viewer into the character's minds through brief \"interviews\" mixed throughout the episode. The show's final season was simulcast in HDTV.1. 1-1 001 21-Sep-1999 Pilot2. 1-2 002 28-Sep-1999 Let's Spend The Night Together3. 1-3 003 05-Oct-1999 The Scarlet Letter Jacket4. 1-4 004 12-Oct-1999 Liars and Other Strangers5. 1-5 005 19-Oct-1999 There Be Dragons6. 1-6 006 26-Oct-1999 A Dream Deferred7. 1-7 007 02-Nov-1999 The Ex-Files8. 1-8 008 09-Nov-1999 The Past is Prologue9. 1-9 010 16-Nov-1999 Outside Hearts10. 1-10 009 23-Nov-1999 Thanksgiving11. 1-11 011 07-Dec-1999 Where There's Smoke12. 1-12 012 21-Dec-1999 The Gingerbread House13. 1-13 014 24-Jan-2000 Mediation14. 1-14 013 31-Jan-2000 Sneaky Feelings15. 1-15 015 07-Feb-2000 The Mystery Dance16. 1-16 016 14-Feb-2000 Daddy's Girl17. 1-17 017 06-Mar-2000 Unfinished Business18. 1-18 018 13-Mar-2000 Strangers and Brothers19. 1-19 019 03-Apr-2000 Cat-In-Hat20. 1-20 020 10-Apr-2000 My Brilliant Career21. 1-21 021 17-Apr-2000 Letting Go22. 1-22 022 24-Apr-2000 A Door, About to Open",
